{{Economy of Balisca}}
 
'''Correo Baliscano''' ({{Literal translation|Baliscan Post}}), officially operating under the name '''Administración de Correos''' ({{Literal translation|Postal Administration}}), is the Baliscan {{W|utility cooperative|cooperative}} {{W|postal service}}. With over 670,000 employees, the Correo Baliscano is the single largest employer in Balisca. Since 2019, the postal division has delivered over 101 million mail parcels each day in Balisca, making it Latin America's largest courier company.

